    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6631a27bb49637af9de4285e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的风格……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f826fd9e38d79df9380501946d8e6c3907953538f6391a72cb34dc606724fd5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e214a87f0df619fda8f698f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "包含我在内，支持葛城王牌的所有人，\n都被她那即使面对逆境或障碍时，\n依旧不屈不挠持续奋斗的生存方式所吸引。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5928ac1d836ee8ebf00797db1eb7d154de609d36b1163620bd30be3c33347c42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b467b7087b0355708eb018ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且这一点，在跑步时也是一样的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bf18dad330bc26f4156d8a00db82abbc0dd61277cc2f9c5a1d5f44fefd3ff2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b75d32a7be519baf62ae4ec6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她那如同突破困难的先锋一样\n不停向前迈进的坚定跑法，\n同样也带给了人们勇气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc9573a75d9e8a40a56139bc270ff7eee87f6b88077c8693e9de051492cb4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dbbe725177c8feb9ad1acfe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的生存方式和跑法鼓励着观众，\n让人们背负着这股意志向“前方”迈进。\n这正是葛城王牌的本质──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e63c8d43643fa7e4291b4ba33a4746788283aee2e6a026b6aaf1260d9e55504",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:023edec52aceff97dc795a12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在这状况只能算是空焦急而已",
      "source_fingerprint": "b78a3d35e10911000d8bbcfa3d472d408b55750843cf1ffc1096ded080d4dfe9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
