    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51e1d708481b98a25490d552",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "暂时停止训练，休息一下……！？\n那是什么意思啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "214d30693ddc5278227e39c8d05b7dca57a33701ad04f69af390ba31fdfbcadb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d0cf4d741ec2984d4c26227",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "换个角度看，才让我重新意识到\n盯着“前方”奋战时，\n才是葛城王牌最强的时候。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f50639de08c8329a363e4fa6abe572631fb7f4125242d4f1cd990103f566c81d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10e4cdff2bf322f9d0ebe8a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不要因为在意“后方”而“逃跑”",
      "source_fingerprint": "088f402a0b6835e985da922f189f98dfeaa0da2bfeb61b78e817df222159b3bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
