    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c08d3d6d69371b2478f29f81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──盯着“前方”奋战时……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ad875b4476bdb170efff2e90aeaae5d6587bede43036ad646e9e2d550f0ddd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f5bad8b130f4fa01652ec9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "专注看着“前方”，“前进”吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7282c6c68733efa2f8144264fc3642c4daf463aa36b2aa9e7190733d0bb8ea18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd05a742e8ed119677a5ac2d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果太在意鲁道夫象征或千明代表\n这些紧追在后的竞争对手，\n只会让自己跑起来畏畏缩缩的并削弱气势。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61cbe3e8be66434a904db2de19ab537d651de1689e46584915d965924ec190af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b125111aa14bf4816c86e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要以最快速度跑向“前方”。\n跑步时只想着往终点迈进。\n就算感觉双脚快要停下来了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60c874a6ca5dfef6791467e5a05b5695da63eb395cbff21c410fbaa8a5c21cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba546e39367b65187b31c6f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相信葛城王牌一定将至今为止\n托付给她的心意转化成力量继续向前迈进。\n不对，她一直都在前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bf4d15300c1e6e48d547d8952ccbc4449d50733fe43d722dcac23334e91f6b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104208.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15b801bf31c49eb74f8ea4dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是只有你才能做到的“王牌”跑法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc067a5f1a63b9ca87b593c479aaf7794a2edc3f76d7ab0d8bd6c7a41492f01d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
